778
00:44:35,780 --> 00:44:37,420
two widows,

779
00:44:37,420 --> 00:44:39,640
Ruth, Naomi, and Orpah,

780
00:44:39,640 --> 00:44:40,860
three widows,

781
00:44:40,860 --> 00:44:43,320
