788
00:44:56,020 --> 00:44:57,900
but this is how it ends in verse 16.

789
00:44:57,900 --> 00:44:58,840
Ruth, Naomi,

790
00:44:58,840 --> 00:45:00,900
widows with no hope for a future,

791
00:45:00,900 --> 00:45:02,300
a struggle for food,

792
00:45:02,300 --> 00:45:03,240
a struggle for family,

793
00:45:03,240 --> 00:45:04,840
