863
00:46:45,060 --> 00:46:45,780
of the chaos

864
00:46:45,780 --> 00:46:46,420
of this world.

865
00:46:46,420 --> 00:46:49,900
But it does mean

866
00:46:49,900 --> 00:46:50,820
if we can just

867
00:46:50,820 --> 00:46:51,780
cling to him

868
00:46:51,780 --> 00:46:52,260
in faith,

869
00:46:52,260 --> 00:46:53,900
continue to wrestle

870
00:46:53,900 --> 00:46:54,840
and ask questions

871
00:46:54,840 --> 00:46:58,120
that he is

872
00:46:58,120 --> 00:46:58,840
and will

873
00:46:58,840 --> 00:46:59,720
and will continue

874
00:46:59,720 --> 00:47:00,860
